}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "邻居半年，阳台相对，借过剪刀和多菌灵，市集偶遇两次后开始约着同去。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "称呼叙之，话说得短，多肉名报得准，喜欢用‘你帮我看看’开头。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "邻居偏熟，单独接触刚从阳台延伸到市集。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:stage", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "虞叙之，耐心挑货、识多肉品种、话不多但回得准", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "桂微澜，含蓄慢热、话少但记得住细节、爱把心意藏在植物里，底线：不轻易收贵的东西、不先开口点破", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "她请我看一盆玉露的叶窗透不透", "subject": "HER", "relation": "请求帮忙", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["你帮我看看这盆玉露，叶窗透不透？"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-07 上午", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 0